{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisites: You must have received a dragon blessing or enhacement from an Young or older Dragon (The dragon must also be a True Dragon, either Chromatic, Gem, Metallic or other) either by favor, the energy released upon it\u0027s death or bathing or drinking portions of it\u0027s blood.\n\nEvolution Prerequisite: You must be a Dragonborn and have at least two Draconic Gift, one of which must be a Draconic Gift of Rebirth.\n\nYour scales harden and the elemental power of your blood increases, granting you the following:\n\nTrue Dragon Scales: You reduce any damage you receive by an amount equal to your proficiency bonus.\n\nDraconic Immunity: You become immune instead of resistant to the main damage type of your draconic heritage.\n\nStronger Blood: The 5th level ability of your Dragonborn race improves, as described below:\n\n- Chromatic Dragonborns that use their Chromatic Warding heal by half the amount of damage they would have received when affected by that damage type for the duration of that feature.\n\n- Gem Dragonborns benefit from their Gem Flight at all times. If they already have a flying speed from another source, increase that flying speed by an amount equal to the one granted by their Gem Flight.\n\n- Metallic Dragonborns have double the AoE of the Secondary Breath to 30-feet. In addition, they can launch it as a bonus action, instead of as part of the Attack action.","level":1}],"id":"Custom7618dc94-c070-42d2-9fea-82768513a9e5","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Draconic Gift of Scaled Power [FTD] [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}